msgid "伐木"
msgstr "Woodcutting"

msgid ""
"主要产出：原木、水果\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 原木 → 转化为炭（冶炼、烹饪所需）\n"
"- 原木 → 建造社区基础设施\n"
"- 水果 → 转化为肥料（农业所需）\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 伐木效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：斧头（提高伐木速度）"
msgstr ""
"Primary Output: Logs, Fruit\n"
"\n"
"Uses:\n"
"- Logs → Convert to Charcoal (required for Smelting, Cooking)\n"
"- Logs → Build Community Infrastructure\n"
"- Fruit → Convert to Fertilizer (required for Farming)\n"
"\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Woodcutting efficiency per level (provides a chance to "
"instantly complete an action)\n"
"Core Tool: Axe (increases Woodcutting speed)"

msgid "采矿"
msgstr "Mining"

msgid ""
"主要产出：矿石、宝石\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 矿石 → 冶炼成锭\n"
"- 宝石 → 冶炼成宝石精华\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 采矿效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：镐子（提高采矿速度）"
msgstr ""
"Primary Output: Ore, Gems\n"
"\n"
"Uses:\n"
"- Ore → Smelt into Ingots\n"
"- Gems → Smelt into Gem Essence\n"
"\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Mining efficiency per level (provides a chance to "
"instantly complete an action)\n"
"Core Tool: Pickaxe (increases Mining speed)"

msgid "冶炼"
msgstr "Smelting"

msgid ""
"制作内容：\n"
"- 矿石 + 炭 → 锭\n"
"- 宝石 + 炭 → 宝石精华\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 锭和宝石精华 → 锻造武器、工具、盔甲、饰品\n"
"- 锭和宝石精华 → 建造社区基础设施\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 冶炼效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：熔炉（提高冶炼速度）"
msgstr ""
"Crafting:\n"
"- Ore + Charcoal → Ingots\n"
"- Gems + Charcoal → Gem Essence\n"
"\n"
"Uses:\n"
"- Ingots and Gem Essence → Forge Weapons, Tools, Armor, Accessories\n"
"- Ingots and Gem Essence → Build Community Infrastructure\n"
"\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Smelting efficiency per level (provides a chance to "
"instantly complete an action)\n"
"Core Building: Furnace (increases Smelting speed)"

msgid "锻造"
msgstr "Smithing"

msgid ""
"制作内容：武器、工具、盔甲、饰品\n"
"所需材料：锭、宝石精华\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 锻造效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：铁砧（提高锻造速度）"
msgstr ""
"Crafting: Weapons, Tools, Armor, Accessories\n"
"Required Materials: Ingots, Gem Essence\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Smithing efficiency per level (provides a chance to "
"instantly complete an action)\n"
"Core Building: Anvil (increases Smithing speed)"

msgid "农业"
msgstr "Farming"

msgid ""
"主要产出：鲜花、蔬菜\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 鲜花 → 炼金术制作药水\n"
"- 蔬菜 → 烹饪豪华料理（战斗治疗）\n"
"\n"
"所需材料：\n"
"- 种子（商店购买）\n"
"- 肥料（由水果转化）\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 农业效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：铲子（提高农业速度）"
msgstr ""
"Primary Output: Flowers, Vegetables\n"
"\n"
"Uses:\n"
"- Flowers → Alchemy for Potions\n"
"- Vegetables → Cooking for Luxurious Meals (Combat Healing)\n"
"\n"
"Required Materials:\n"
"- Seeds (Purchased from Shop)\n"
"- Fertilizer (Converted from Fruit)\n"
"\n"
"Skill Bonus: +0.25% Farming efficiency per level (provides a chance to "
"instantly complete an action)\n"
"Core Tool: Shovel (increases Farming speed)"

msgid "炼金"
msgstr "Alchemie"

msgid ""
"制作内容：各类药水\n"
"\n"
"所需材料：\n"
"- 鲜花（农业）\n"
"- 骨头（战斗）\n"
"- 瓶子（商店）\n"
"\n"
"药水效果：提供多种增益效果，默认持续 180 秒\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 炼金效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：炼金实验室（提高炼金速度）"
msgstr ""
"Geproduceerde inhoud: diverse drankjes\n"
"\n"
"Benodigde materialen:\n"
"- Bloemen (Landbouw)\n"
"- Botten (Gevecht)\n"
"- Flessen (Winkel)\n"
"\n"
"Drankje-effect: Biedt diverse buff-effecten, standaard duur 180 "
"seconden\n"
"Vaardigheidsbonus: +0,25% alchemie-efficiëntie per niveau (biedt kans op "
"onmiddellijke voltooiing van acties)\n"
"Kerngebouw: Alchemielab (verhoogt alchemiesnelheid)"

msgid "钓鱼"
msgstr "Vissen"

msgid ""
"主要产出：鱼\n"
"用途：烹饪料理（战斗治疗）\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 钓鱼效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：鱼竿（提高钓鱼速度）"
msgstr ""
"Hoofdproduct: Vis\n"
"Gebruik: Koken (gevechtsgenezing)\n"
"Vaardigheidsbonus: +0,25% visserij-efficiëntie per niveau (biedt kans op "
"onmiddellijke voltooiing van acties)\n"
"Kerngereedschap: Vislijn (verhoogt visserijsnelheid)"

msgid "烹饪"
msgstr "Koken"

msgid ""
"制作内容：各类料理\n"
"所需材料：食材（鱼和蔬菜）+ 炭\n"
"料理效果：战斗中生命值低于 33% 时自动使用，恢复生命值（冷却时间 15 秒）\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 烹饪效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：烹饪锅（提高烹饪速度）"
msgstr ""
"Geproduceerde inhoud: diverse gerechten\n"
"Benodigde materialen: Ingrediënten (vis en groenten) + Kolen\n"
"Gerecht-effect: Automatisch gebruikt wanneer levenspunten in gevecht onder "
"33% zijn, herstelt levenspunten (afkoeltijd 15 seconden)\n"
"Vaardigheidsbonus: +0,25% kook-efficiëntie per niveau (biedt kans op "
"onmiddellijke voltooiing van acties)\n"
"Kerngebouw: Kookpot (verhoogt kooksnelheid)"

msgid "狩猎"
msgstr "Jagen"

msgid ""
"主要产出：皮革、墨水、羽毛\n"
"用途：制作地图（制图技能所需）\n"
"所需材料：蚯蚓（钓鱼获得）\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 狩猎效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心工具：陷阱（提高狩猎速度）"
msgstr ""
"Hoofdproduct: Leer, Inkt, Veren\n"
"Gebruik: Kaarten maken (vereist voor cartografievaardigheid)\n"
"Benodigde materialen: Regenwormen (verkregen via vissen)\n"
"Vaardigheidsbonus: +0,25% jacht-efficiëntie per niveau (biedt kans op "
"onmiddellijke voltooiing van acties)\n"
"Kerngereedschap: Val (verhoogt jachtsnelheid)"

msgid "制图"
msgstr "Cartografie"

msgid ""
"制作内容：地图\n"
"所需材料：皮革、墨水、羽毛\n"
"\n"
"用途：\n"
"- 考古技能消耗品\n"
"- 挑战精英怪物所需\n"
"\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 制图效率（提供立即完成行动的概率）\n"
"核心建筑：制图台（提高制图速度）"
msgstr ""
"Geproduceerde inhoud: Kaart\n"
"Benodigde materialen: Leer, Inkt, Veren\n"
"\n"
"Gebruik:\n"
"- Verbruiksgoed voor archeologievaardigheid\n"
"- Vereist voor uitdagingen tegen elite monsters\n"
"\n"
"Vaardigheidsbonus: +0,25% cartografie-efficiëntie per niveau (biedt kans op "
"onmiddellijke voltooiing van acties)\n"
"Kerngebouw: Cartografietafel (verhoogt cartografiesnelheid)"

msgid "考古"
msgstr "Archeologie"

msgid ""
"特殊机制：被动技能，可与其他技能同时进行\n"
"所需材料：地图\n"
"主要产出：神器\n"
"\n"
"神器系统：\n"
"- 建造祭坛后可激活神器\n"
"- 最多同时激活 3 个神器\n"
"- 激活需要消耗资源\n"
"\n"
"加速方式：使用星星加速考古进度"
msgstr ""
"Speciaal mechanisme: Passieve vaardigheid, kan tegelijkertijd met andere "
"vaardigheden worden uitgevoerd\n"
"Benodigde materialen: Kaart\n"
"Hoofdproduct: Artefacten\n"
"\n"
"Artefactsysteem:\n"
"- Bouw een 'altaar' om artefacten te activeren\n"
"- Maximaal 3 artefacten tegelijkertijd activeren\n"
"- Activering vereist het verbruik van bronnen\n"
"\n"
"Versnelling: Gebruik sterren om archeologievoortgang te versnellen"

msgid "单手武器"
msgstr "Eenhandig wapen"

msgid ""
"武器类型：剑、锤子\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 单手效率（训练时有机会双倍战斗经验和战利品）\n"
"\n"
"命中率机制：\n"
"基础命中率：75%（等级匹配时）\n"
"每高于怪物 1 级：+0.5% 命中率（上限 90%）\n"
"每低于怪物 1 级：-0.5% 命中率"
msgstr ""
"Wapentype: Zwaard, Hamer\n"
"Vaardigheidsbonus: +0,25% eenhandige-efficiëntie per niveau (training geeft "
"kans op dubbele gevechtservaring en buit)\n"
"\n"
"Trefkansmechanisme:\n"
"Basis trefkans: 75% (bij gelijk niveau)\n"
"Per niveau hoger dan monster: +0,5% trefkans (limiet 90%)\n"
"Per niveau lager dan monster: -0,5% trefkans"

msgid "双手武器"
msgstr "Tweehandig wapen"

msgid ""
"武器类型：长矛、镰刀\n"
"技能加成：每级 +0.25% 双手效率（训练时有机会双倍战斗经验和战利品）\n"
"\n"
"命中率机制：\n"
"基础命中率：75%（等级匹配时）\n"
"每高于怪物 1 级：+0.5% 命中率（上限 90%）\n"
"每低于怪物 1 级：-0.5% 命中率"
msgstr ""
